  "-327485551": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1858363319,
   "actor": "Adrian",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Tomorrow’s our last day, so I was thinking we could just take it easy—maybe check out a mangastore or something.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-970263809": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1858363319,
   "actor": "Adrian",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "We should hit up one of those giant convenience stores. I want to see if the snacks are really as good as people say.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1575755161": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1858363319,
   "actor": "Adrian",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I’m kind of curious about that train museum I read about... or is that too lame?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-2015941763": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1858363319,
   "actor": "Adrian",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Do you think we’ll have time to just walk around and people-watch? I feel like we’ve been rushing everywhere.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-750207831": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1858363319,
   "actor": "Adrian",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Maybe we can grab a coffee and chill somewhere quiet tomorrow. Nothing too crazy.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1504996840": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1858363319,
   "actor": "Adrian",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I wouldn’t mind checking out one of those 100-yen shops. I bet they’ve got some cool stuff.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1340363438": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1858363319,
   "actor": "Adrian",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Tomorrow we should meet some Yakuza! Like in those games! ... I'm just kidding, how about checking out a ramen place?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
